---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="SG-RVA01 — Receiver Representation Validity Analyzer | Solo Ghost"
  description="Explore receiver representation aging, CSI reuse consequences, and state-refresh decisions with Solo Ghost SG-RVA01."
>
  <div class="container product-page">
    <section class="product-hero">
      <p class="eyebrow">SOLO GHOST / ENGINEERING SOFTWARE</p>

      <h1>SG-RVA01</h1>
      <h2>Receiver Representation Validity Analyzer</h2>

      <p class="lead">
        Understand when a retained receiver representation may no longer
        be suitable for the current wireless channel.
      </p>

      <a class="primary-button" href="/products/sg-rva01/request/">
        Request Private Evaluation →
      </a>

      <p class="status">STATUS: PRIVATE ENGINEERING EVALUATION</p>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">THE PROBLEM</p>
      <h2>Channel information ages. Receiver assumptions can age with it.</h2>

      <p>
        Wireless receivers reuse channel-dependent processing states to
        reduce estimation and computation overhead. As propagation
        conditions evolve, retained receiver representations may become
        inaccurate even when they were previously valid.
      </p>

      <p>
        SG-RVA01 provides an engineering environment for investigating
        how representation aging affects receiver performance and when
        additional state maintenance may be beneficial.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">CAPABILITIES</p>
      <h2>Investigate receiver validity before committing to a refresh policy.</h2>

      <div class="capability-grid">
        <article>
          <h3>Representation Aging</h3>
          <p>
            Explore how changing channel conditions affect the suitability
            of retained receiver representations.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>Receiver Consequences</h3>
          <p>
            Compare fresh and retained receiver-state configurations
            through selected performance metrics and demonstration scenarios.
          </p>
        </article>

        <article>
          <h3>State Maintenance</h3>
          <p>
            Examine candidate state-maintenance alternatives and their
            performance consequences under specified assumptions.
          </p>
        </article>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">EVALUATION</p>
      <h2>Research-backed engineering exploration.</h2>

      <p>
        SG-RVA01 builds on Solo Ghost's research into receiver
        representation validity and channel-state aging.
        Evaluation scenarios distinguish controlled analytical results,
        simulation evidence, and illustrative behavior.
      </p>

      <p>
        Results depend on the selected channel models, receiver
        assumptions, and evaluation conditions. SG-RVA01 is currently
        an engineering evaluation tool, not a production receiver.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section class="product-section final-section">
      <p class="eyebrow">PRIVATE ACCESS</p>
      <h2>Evaluate SG-RVA01 with Solo Ghost.</h2>

      <p>
        Private technical evaluations are offered by request.
        Access is subject to review and approval.
      </p>

      <a class="primary-button" href="/products/sg-rva01/request/">
        Request Private Evaluation →
      </a>
    </section>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .product-page {
    max-width: 1000px;
  }

  .product-hero {
    padding: 110px 0 100px;
  }

  .eyebrow,
  .status {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  h1 {
    font-size: clamp(3.5rem, 9vw, 6rem);
    letter-spacing: -0.065em;
    line-height: 1.1;
    margin: 24px 0 8px;
  }

  .product-hero h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 3vw, 2rem);
    font-weight: 450;
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }

  .lead {
    max-width: 680px;
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
  }

  .primary-button {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--text);
    color: white;
    padding: 14px 24px;
    font-weight: 600;
    border-radius: 4px;
  }

  .primary-button:hover {
    text-decoration: none;
    opacity: 0.85;
  }

  .status {
    margin-top: 26px;
  }

  .product-section {
    padding: 80px 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--line);
  }

  .product-section h2 {
    max-width: 740px;
    font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 2.7rem);
    line-height: 1.2;
    letter-spacing: -0.035em;
    margin: 18px 0 30px;
  }

  .product-section > p:not(.eyebrow) {
    max-width: 760px;
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .capability-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 28px;
    margin-top: 48px;
  }

  .capability-grid article {
    border-top: 2px solid var(--text);
    padding-top: 18px;
  }

  .capability-grid h3 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
  }

  .capability-grid p {
    color: var(--muted);
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .final-section {
    padding-bottom: 60px;
  }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .product-hero {
      padding: 70px 0;
    }

    .product-section {
      padding: 55px 0;
    }

    .capability-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>